>878</span><span class="rf-text">Alfred defeats <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/guthrum">Guthrum</a> at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-edington">Battle of Edington</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">886</span><span class="rf-text">Alfred occupies <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/london">London</a> and is recognised as king of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/anglo-saxons">Anglo-Saxons</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">927</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/aethelstan">Æthelstan</a> takes <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/york">York</a> and becomes king of the English</span></li></ol>
